You are creating a voxel game in Java 25 using Maven inspired by Minecraft using latest LWJGL and the highest OpenGL supported by on Macbook Pro M4.

Make sure rendering works for both retina and non retina displays. Use OOP principles. Search web to learn new concepts.

Use shaders for graphics rendering. I intend to make the game look photorealistic in terms of lightning, colors etc.

Always run mvn clean install to ensure no compile errors when you are finished.